{Branko Rogulj showed great determination in this game. He flew in from Zagreb
today and had to start late. he then played about 7 hours non-stop. Perhaps
Stuart made a mistake here and should have demanded his entitled adjournment.
Certainly he looked very tired at the end, and I remember grinding him down in
a similar manner in a weekend Swisss, albeit about 4 years ago!} 1. d4 Nf6 2.
