ill-conceived, a discreet move such as f4 seemd to be called for, White is
pursuing the bishop pair at too great a cost. 26 Rf3 was a simple blunder,
Rad1 was much more satisfactory.} 1. d4 d5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. g3 Bf5 4. Bg2 e6 5.
