{Both players took a considerable amount of time reaching the position where
Conquest was able to play his TN on move 20. Play was reasonably evenly
balanced until move 32, when best must have been 32 f4. The game would then be
decided around whether Black could increase his bishop's scope by playing c5.
Stuart simply overlooked that the b2 pawn was en prise.} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3.
