{A game replete with tactical errors. Some have complained about the heat in
the tournament hall, which does leave a great deal to be desired. 21...a5
would have avoided the loss of material. Even 22...Rfc8 would have helped in
that way, although it is an extremely ugly move. 50 h4 is an elementary error.
50...Kd5 leaves the issue in no doubt whatsoever. A pity. We had high hopes of
this Scottish derby.} 1. d4 g6 2. e4 Bg7 3. Nc3 d6 4. f4 c6 5. Be3 Qb6 6. Rb1
